/-- **`mp_div_d(a, b, c, d)`**: `c ← a / b` (truncated), `*d ← |a| mod b` (`rem p`, in `out`), for a
digit `b > 0` and `c` with room (`a0`: `retv`, `MP_VAL` for `b = 0`). -/
