/-- **`mp_init_multi(a₁, …, aₖ, NULL)`**: each `aᵢ ← 0` with `MP_PREC` digits, or `MP_MEM` with the
ones initialized before the failure cleared (`Post`); `Pre`: the structs, the stack-passed
